      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "CH'ÊN Ch'i-yü 陳奇瑜 (T. 玉鉉, H. 正學), d. 1648, Ming official, was a native of Pao-tê-chou, Shansi. A chin-shih of 1616, he was appointed magistrate of Loyang, Honan. He was promoted to a censor and memorialized against the eunuch, Wei Chung-hsien [q. v.].",
